      "standardized_narrative": "At 31 December 2018 the syndicate carried opening gross claims outstanding of $701.294m (opening balance at 1 January 2018). The report records a deterioration in prior-year reserves (net) of $10.701m, driven by adverse claims development largely linked to natural catastrophe and large individual losses (notably Californian wildfires, Typhoon Jebi and the Lrssen shipyard fire). Reserve pressure was concentrated in the reinsurance and marine/hull related portfolios; specialty lines contributed positively overall. No single gross prior-year movement figure is provided in the notes, so the syndicate's reported net deterioration has been used as the quantified prior-year movement.",
